        library ipaddress module (3.3+) provides IPAddress and IPNetwork equivalents with similar APIs. EUI (MAC address handling)
        would require netaddr or a separate library like netifaces. ipaddress is a viable drop-in for the IP address/network 
        parsing and validation used here.

